putMapHelpers is operation
putMapHelpers purpose "Define a map type's members as calls of the host's map, keys and values flattened to 64-bit slots as the LLVM backend flattens them: new (`mn_`, telling the host its keys are text and whether its values are), put (`mp_`, copying the text a stored record or enum holds into the map's region first), get (`mg_`), contains (`mc_`), remove (`mr_`), length (`ml_`), and the key at a position (`mk_`, for forEach)"
