# ---------------------------------------------------------------- one operation as a C function
putLocals is operation
putLocals purpose "Declare an operation's values, failure flags, loop counters and positions, and regions; read its module's constants; then set its lets (a let of an operationType names an operation, `o_<module>_<name>`)"
putLocals invariant none
putLocals typeParameter none
